    "### 15. Vectorized Backprop for a Linear Layer\n",
    "For $\\mathbf{y} = W\\mathbf{x} + \\mathbf{b}$:\n",
    "- $\\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial W} = \\left(\\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial \\mathbf{y}}\\right) \\mathbf{x}^T$\n",
    "- $\\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial \\mathbf{x}} = W^T \\left(\\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial \\mathbf{y}}\\right)$"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "W = np.random.randn(2, 3)\n",
    "x = np.random.randn(3)\n",
    "dy = np.random.randn(2)\n",
    "\n",
    "dW = np.outer(dy, x)\n",
    "dx = W.T @ dy\n",
    "print(\"dW:\\n\", dW)\n",
    "print(\"dx:\\n\", dx)"
   ]
  }
